{"availability":"available","full":"alesorrentino29dotai/mail2deck","name":"mail2deck","description":"Forward an email → get a finished, on-brand presentation. Self-hosted, local LLM, grounding + critique guard, human-in-the-loop. No cloud.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-12T07:45:04Z","updated":"2026-07-12T08:46:20Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":["agent","ai","gradio","llm","powerpoint","pptx","presentation","python","self-hosted","vllm"],"demo":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2308.11432","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:33:58.834Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T22:33:58.834Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T22:33:58.834Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T22:33:58.834Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Forward an email → get a finished, on-brand presentation. Runs on your own hardware, against any OpenAI-compatible LLM, with a grounding/critique guard and a human-in-the-loop gate.","The deck above — cover, summary, content slides, figures pulled from a linked paper, and closing — was generated end to end from the request email on the left. No template file, no manual design, no cloud AI service (the native path renders in well under a minute; web-fetch adds an opt-in network call for the figures).","Most \"AI PPT\" tools are cloud SaaS: your content leaves your infrastructure and the model invents freely. mail2deck is built for the opposite — run it locally, keep a tight leash on grounding, and make the human the final gate. Every outbound network call is opt-in, and no LLM ever runs in the render path."],"features":["Any OpenAI-compatible LLM — vLLM, Ollama, llama.cpp, or a hosted API. Reasoning-model aware (auto-disables chain-of-thought for clean JSON).","Native branded output, no template needed — the native backend draws a fully branded 16:9 deck (cover, summary, section dividers, footers, page numbers, closing) from a small Theme (colours + font + wordmark). Ships…","Grounding + critique guard — an adversarial LLM pass checks every claim against the source (sourceref per slide), flags hallucinations, missing info, tone, and classification markers (configurable). A marker hit stops…","Two render backends — native (deterministic python-pptx, approved text verbatim) or presenton (AI-designed themed decks; richer, looser grounding).","Web enrichment (opt-in) — fetch URLs found in the prompt (browser-grade TLS impersonation for bot-protected pages) and pull page text + images into the deck."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alesorrentino29dotai/mail2deck/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"abb23b559480665962a51ac6dc7793b3465bcc59fb32b434f0e9245525e86c8a","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T22:33:58.947Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:33:58.947Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Forward an email → get a finished, on-brand presentation. Runs on your own hardware, against any OpenAI-compatible LLM, with a grounding/critique guard and a human-in-the-loop gate.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alesorrentino29dotai/mail2deck/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Most \"AI PPT\" tools are cloud SaaS: your content leaves your infrastructure and the model invents freely. mail2deck is built for the opposite — run it locally, keep a tight leash on grounding, and make the human the final gate. Every outbound network call is opt-in, and no LLM ever runs in the render path.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alesorrentino29dotai/mail2deck/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"abb23b559480665962a51ac6dc7793b3465bcc59fb32b434f0e9245525e86c8a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alesorrentino29dotai/mail2deck/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T22:33:58.947Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-07-12T08:46:20Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alesorrentino29dotai/mail2deck/blob/main/READM